.TH QUIPU-ENTITY-REF-MINT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-entity\-ref\-mint \- Mint a typed stable entity reference from a JSON request
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu entity\-ref mint\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIrequest.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mint a typed stable entity reference from a JSON request
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIrequest.json\fR>

